  "content": "<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/hats-renewed/assets/banner.png\" alt=\"Hats Renewed banner\"></center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/hats-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=53051224\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/NbAJwj8RHg\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@yesman4100\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/youtube.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Antikythera-Studios/Hats-renewed\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/github.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hats-renewed\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/curseforge.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n</center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/hats-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n## Hats Renewed\n\n<center><em>Hats Renewed 添加了 430 多种可收集的帽子和配饰供玩家解锁。包含稀有度等级、自定义颜色以及可解锁的配饰，让你随心所欲地调整帽子。</em></center>\n\n**如何解锁帽子：** 帽子是可穿戴的装饰物，会出现在生物身上并由玩家收集。当生物生成时，一定比例的生物会被随机分配一顶帽子，击杀这些生物并收集它们的帽子即可。\n\n**如何装备/查看帽子：** 默认情况下，你可以按键盘上的 \"H\" 键打开帽子界面。\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/hats-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n## ✨ 特性\n\n- **自定义** - 自定义颜色和视觉效果！\n- **配饰** - 解锁并浏览无数让帽子独一无二的配饰！\n- **经典兼容** - 体验原版 Hats 模组中的所有经典帽子和配饰！\n- **交易** - 完全交互式的用户界面，可与朋友交换帽子！\n- **帽子发射器** - 给你的好友生物戴上帽子，或将帽子发射出去！\n- **新帽子** - 发现并收集拥有全新外观的帽子！\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/hats-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n## 📷 截图\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/hats-renewed/assets/21312312341234.png\" alt=\"media\"></center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/hats-renewed/assets/123124334134.png\" alt=\"media\"></center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/hats-renewed/assets/2312341343541.png\" alt=\"media\"></center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/hats-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n## 📥 安装\n\n**需要客户端和服务器端同时安装！**\n\n**Forge/Neoforge 需要：**\n\n- [Architectury API](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api)\n\n**Fabric 需要：**\n\n- [Architectury API](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api)\n- [Forge Config API Port](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port)\n- [Fabric API](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api)\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/hats-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n## ⚙️ 配置\n\n大多数选项可以通过直接编辑 `.minecraft/config/hats.toml` 配置文件来更改。你应该可以在这里根据需要调整模组设置，包括更改生成戴帽子生物的概率。\n\n> 💡 **提示：** 对配置文件的修改将在下次加载世界时生效。\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/hats-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n## ❤️ 致谢\n\n由 **Antikythera Studios** 精心移植和维护。\n这是 Hats 模组的 1.20+ 版本，最初由 iChun 为 Forge 1.6.2-1.16.5 开发。原始项目采用 LGPL 许可证。原模组的开发已于 2023 年停止，此版本继续该项目以支持现代游戏版本，并为 Forge、NeoForge 和 Fabric（1.20+）提供支持。此版本并非旧模组的 1:1 移植，我保留了模组的核心概念，并以更易于维护和扩展的方式重新制作。一些想法（如帽子交易）也被整合到此移植版中，我也移除了一些我认为不必要的内容（如积分系统）。\n\n感谢 [iChun](https://www.curseforge.com/members/ichun/projects) 提供的原始概念和实现。如果你喜欢这个模组，请考虑支持他的其他作品 ❤️。\n\n- **代码与新帽子** - Antikythera Studios 团队\n- **经典帽子** - iChun 及贡献者\n\n喜欢这个模组吗？在仓库上给一个 ⭐ 并在 Modrinth / CurseForge 上推荐该模组，对你的帮助比你想象的要大得多。\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/hats-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n<center><a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=2724\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/hats-renewed/assets/support.png\" alt=\"Support & Affiliates\"></a></center>",
